Package: SpectralMM
Type: Package
Title: Spectral Majorization for Statistical Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xun-Jian", "Li", email = "xunjianli@ucla.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits generalized linear, asymmetric and robust regression models
    using spectral majorization and iterative quadratic subproblem solvers.
    A shared C++ computational core supports dense and sparse designs, automatic
    intercepts, optional Wald inference and detailed iteration diagnostics.
    Native code is compiled automatically during package installation.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: Rcpp, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppEigen
Suggests: Matrix
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
URL: https://github.com/Xunjian-Li/SpectralMM
BugReports: https://github.com/Xunjian-Li/SpectralMM/issues
